> Should x2 be "species" or "species of gambier/peacock/walrus" or
> "gambier/peacock/walrus species" or omitted? Putting "species" will
> result in a definition for "species" that's at least a dozen pages;
> putting "gambier etc. species" will result in lots of extra entries;
> omitting them means that all dictionary users will have to know that
> all animal, plant, and fungus names have the species as x2.

